{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-14","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2014,"subject":"chemistry","number":14,"points":1.5,"unitId":"acid","unitLabel":"산·염기 평형","topic":"pH·산해리","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["acid"],"stem":"표는 수용액에서 몇 가지 화학종의 산해리 상수(Ka)를 나타낸 \n것이다.\nKa\n화학종\n+\nNH4\n5.6×10−10\n+\nCH3NH3\n2.3×10−11\nHSO4\n−\n1.2×10−2\nHClO\n3.5×10−8\nHClO2\n(가)\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? \n [1.5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 0.1M NH3 수용액의 pH는 0.1M CH3NH2 수용액의 pH\n보다 낮다. \nㄴ. NaHSO4 0.010mol과 HCl 0.010mol을 함께 녹인 수용액 \n1.0L의 pH는 2.0보다 높다. \nㄷ. (가)는 3.5×10−8보다 작다. ","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t027"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t028"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t029"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t030"]}],"answer":1,"acceptedAnswers":[1],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":623,"height":319,"region":0,"bbox":[39.9,56.536,249.2,127.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-14/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":282,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,245.336,310.4,112.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-deet-science2-14/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":8,"sourceRect":[82.9,153.464,417.0,560.962],"width":334.1,"height":407.498,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[39.9,56.536,249.2,127.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bb